<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Aug 27.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Aug 27.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Southampton asa 108.00 Sep 109.50</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 113.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk asa 108.00 Sep 109.00 Oct/Dec 113.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to East Anglia asa 100.00 Sep 103.00 Oct/Dec 108.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Sep 104.50</p>
<p>No milling wheat trade was reported.</p>
</text>
